{
  "source": "Prompts/avoid-opener-2.mp4",
  "duration": 195.32625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.68,
      "text": "The underlying architecture that makes artificial intelligence so capable at generating language"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.68,
      "end": 9.98,
      "text": "and images is the exact same machinery that causes it to fail."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.82,
      "end": 12.42,
      "text": "These failures are highly predictable."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.14,
      "end": 15.34,
      "text": "They happen in specific repeating patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.36,
      "end": 19.64,
      "text": "The real danger for the user is the complete lack of friction."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.54,
      "end": 24.72,
      "text": "When a language model hallucinates, you don't get a flashing red light or an error code."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.1,
      "end": 31.18,
      "text": "A completely fabricated statistic arrives with absolute certainty and a highly authoritative tone."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.12,
      "end": 36.84,
      "text": "A conversational assistant wraps incorrect answers in polite flattery and smooth pacing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.16,
      "end": 40.22,
      "text": "making the mistake feels psychologically satisfying to read."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.22,
      "end": 48.3,
      "text": "A synthetic image or a cloned voice mimics physical reality so precisely that your eyes and ears naturally accepted as truth."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.18,
      "end": 52.4,
      "text": "We are conditioned to expect software to fail loudly."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.08,
      "end": 57.28,
      "text": "A traditional program crashes, a screen freezes or a webpage distorts."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.22,
      "end": 61.4,
      "text": "Because generative systems strip away all of that visible friction,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 66.76,
      "text": "relying on your standard instinct to scan for broken elements is a dangerous strategy."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.74,
      "end": 73.38,
      "text": "To understand how this deception works, we need to step away from digital interfaces and look at the physical world."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.3,
      "end": 75.84,
      "text": "Think about a coastal rip current."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.48,
      "end": 79.12,
      "text": "To the untrained eye, this doesn't look like a hazard."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.58,
      "end": 85.3,
      "text": "A calm, flat channel situated right between breaking waves looks like the most inviting place to swim."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.02,
      "end": 91.76,
      "text": "But that smooth surface is actually masking a powerful, concentrated column of water"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.76,
      "end": 93.9,
      "text": "moving in the exact opposite direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.78,
      "end": 100.46,
      "text": "If you step into that calm water, the current will quickly and quietly pull you far away from the shore."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.44,
      "end": 104.92,
      "text": "Surviving this environment has nothing to do with physical strength."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.4,
      "end": 108.9,
      "text": "Once you are caught in the flow, you cannot muscle your way out."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.62,
      "end": 115.68,
      "text": "The actual survival skill is identifying the specific shape of the hazard before your feet leave the sand."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.52,
      "end": 125.04,
      "text": "Professional lifeguards spot these traps constantly because they are trained exclusively to recognize the visual signature of that suspiciously calm water."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.74,
      "end": 130.1,
      "text": "Interacting with artificial intelligence requires this exact same preventative mindset."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.1,
      "end": 135.5,
      "text": "The technology has its own digital rip currents, and safely utilizing these tools"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.5,
      "end": 140.1,
      "text": "means recognizing their specific shapes before you get pulled into the deception."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.12,
      "end": 146.0,
      "text": "The upcoming section is a practical guide designed to train your eye to spot these digital hazards."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.86,
      "end": 149.34,
      "text": "We will start by examining the machine's false confidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.22,
      "end": 153.18,
      "text": "Why can AI sound so sure and still be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.88,
      "end": 157.04,
      "text": "Next, we address psychological traps encouraging over trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.82,
      "end": 160.06,
      "text": "When might I be trusting AI too much?"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.78,
      "end": 164.08,
      "text": "Finally, we outline verification steps for synthetic media."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.0,
      "end": 169.94,
      "text": "If AI can create convincing fakes, what should I check before trusting what I see or hear?"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.56,
      "end": 177.06,
      "text": "These three questions provide the foundational navigational tools you need to safely explore the generative landscape."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.94,
      "end": 181.58,
      "text": "Keep the core danger of the illusion of perfection in mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.06,
      "end": 184.74,
      "text": "When AI fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.66,
      "end": 188.84,
      "text": "Navigating the space requires looking past the calm surface."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.84,
      "end": 191.72,
      "text": "This section teaches you to read the water."
    }
  ],
